title: Presidential Election
subtitle: Finally, presidential elections can be held again...
view-if: presidential_timer <= 0 and victory_republic and not presidency_abolished and presidency_vacated
frequency: 1000
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
on-arrival: old_braun = braun_campaign; braun_campaign = 0; spd_support_thalmann = 0; spd_support_gessler = 0; kpd_support_braun = 0; z_support_braun = 0; wirth_campaign = 1 if president == "Wirth"; hergt_campaign = 1 if dnvp_banned != 1; luther_campaign = 1 if dvp_banned != 1 and dvp_relation < 35; gessler_campaign = 1 if dvp_banned != 1 and dvp_relation >= 35; thalmann_campaign = 1 if kpd_party_leader != "Conciliators" and kpd_banned != 1; munzenberg_campaign = 1 if kpd_party_leader == "Conciliators" and kpd_banned != 1; adenauer_campaign = 1 if z_relation < 50 and president != "Wirth"
tags: event
go-to: election_algorithm
set-jump: pres_election

= 总统选举

终于,随着国家走出内战,总统选举即将举行。 [? if not kpd_banned : The KPD is planning to run [? if kpd_party_leader == "Conciliators" : Willi Münzenberg?][? if kpd_party_leader != "Conciliators" : Ernst Thälmann?] ?][? if z_relation < 50 or dvp_banned != 1 or dnvp_banned != 1 :[? if not kpd_banned :, while the?][? if kpd_banned : The?] right rallies behind[? if dnvp_banned != 1 : Oskar Hergt?][? if dnvp_banned and dvp_banned != 1 and dvp_relation < 35 : Hans Luther?][? if dnvp_banned and dvp_banned and president == "Wirth" : Joseph Wirth?][? if dnvp_banned and dvp_banned and president != "Wirth" and z_relation < 50 : Konrad Adenauer?][? if dvp_banned != 1 and dnvp_banned and dvp_relation >= 35 : Otto Gessler ?] ?]. 

[? if president == "Wirth" : Joseph Wirth is tired, but will run for re-election if we support him. ?] 我们可以说服奥托·布劳恩参选,也可以支持另一位候选人。库尔特·舒马赫在内战期间崭露头角;若布劳恩不愿参选,我们也可以选择推他出马。

@pres_election

- @support_braun: Run Otto Braun.
- @support_braun2: Run Otto Braun.
- @support_schumacher: Run Kurt Schumacher.
- @support_wirth: Support Joseph Wirth.
- @support_thalmann: Support Ernst Thälmann.
- @support_munzenberg: Support Willi Münzenberg.
- @support_gessler: Support Otto Gessler.
- @support_adenauer: Support Konrad Adenauer.

@support_braun2
view-if: (old_braun or not spd_prussia) and achievement_megatome
subtitle: He's sleepy, but we can use the Megatome to enter his dreams.

我们渐渐睡去……

- @dream: We have a nice dream.
- @prospit: ...and wake up on Prospit.
- @derse: ...and wake up on Derse.

@dream
view-if: not bright_moon and not dark_moon
go-to: pres_election

在梦里,奥托·布劳恩在维系了一天摇摇欲坠的人民阵线之后,正与奥托·韦尔斯和保罗·冯·兴登堡打高尔夫。真是温馨啊。

@prospit
view-if: bright_moon
set-bg: img/Prospit.webp
subtitle: The Kingdom of Light
on-arrival: {!
const toolsWrapper = document.getElementById('tools_wrapper');
if (toolsWrapper) {
  toolsWrapper.style.display = 'none';
}
const elements = document.querySelectorAll('header, #content, footer');
elements.forEach(el => {
  el.style.maxWidth = '800px';
}); !}

我们在一个金光闪烁的星球上醒来,它环绕着一个看起来像天空的巨大物体运行,我们凭直觉知道它叫斯凯亚。从当地人 —— 一种奇特的、棋子形状、社会以棋类为基础的物种 —— 那里我们得知,这里是普罗斯皮特,即光之王国。它与黑暗王国,也就是德尔斯,已经交战了很久很久很久。那个巨大的蓝色之物,我们从他们那里得知 —— 尽管凭直觉的力量我们早已知道 —— 就是斯凯亚。

- @miracles: We are here to awaken a time of miracles.

@miracles

我们希望能唱起剑巫术之歌,以寻获并驯服明月三角。

@derse
view-if: dark_moon
set-bg: img/Derse.webp
subtitle: The Kingdom of Darkness
on-arrival: {!
const toolsWrapper = document.getElementById('tools_wrapper');
if (toolsWrapper) {
  toolsWrapper.style.display = 'none';
}
const elements = document.querySelectorAll('header, #content, footer');
elements.forEach(el => {
  el.style.maxWidth = '800px';
}); !}

我们在一颗脉动着紫色的星球上醒来,浸润在外太空深沉漆黑的黑暗之中。

@support_braun
view-if: not ((old_braun or not spd_prussia) and achievement_megatome)
subtitle: -2 资源.
choose-if: not old_braun and spd_prussia
unavailable-subtitle: 他困了。
on-arrival: resources -= 2; braun_campaign = 1; wirth_campaign = 0; motivate_adenauer = 1 if z_relation < 50 and president == "Wirth"; adenauer_campaign = 1 if z_relation < 50; z_support_braun = 1 if z_relation >= 50
go-to: spd_presidential

奥托·布劳恩勉强同意竞选总统,作为我们的候选人参加角逐。 [? if motivate_adenauer : 我们参选促使[? if not zca_formed : 中央党 ?][? if zca_formed : 中央基督教联盟 ?]推出康拉德·阿登纳与我们竞争。 ?][? if z_relation >= 50 : 中央党支持奥托·布劳恩。 ?]

@support_schumacher
subtitle: -2 资源.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; schumacher_campaign = 1; wirth_campaign = 0; motivate_adenauer = 1 if z_relation < 50 and president == "Wirth"; adenauer_campaign = 1 if z_relation < 50; z_support_schumacher = 1 if z_relation >= 50
go-to: spd_presidential

库尔特·舒马赫欣然同意竞选总统,作为我们的候选人参加角逐。 [? if motivate_adenauer : 我们参选促使中央党推出康拉德·阿登纳与我们竞争。 ?][? if z_relation >= 50 : 中央党支持奥托·布劳恩。 ?]

@support_wirth
subtitle: The incumbent, interim president.
view-if: wirth_campaign
on-arrival: z_relation += 5

约瑟夫·维尔特经过一番考虑,同意作为魏玛派候选人竞选连任,并得到我们、[+ ddp_name +],当然还有中央党的支持。

- @final_election: The final results...

@support_thalmann
subtitle: Thälmann is very unpopular among the reformists.
view-if: kpd_party_leader != "Conciliators"
choose-if: kpd_relation >= 50 and reformist_strength < left_strength
unavailable-subtitle: [? if kpd_relation < 50 : 我们与共产党的关系还不够好,他们甚至不愿接受我们的支持。 ?] [? if reformist_strength >= left_strength : 改良派能够劝住全党,不支持这一安排。 ?]

即便共产党人接受我们的支持,支持台尔曼在我党中也颇不受欢迎。你确定吗?

- @support_thalmann_2: Yes, we will support Thälmann, despite the reformists' pleas against it.
- @pres_election: Support someone else.

@support_thalmann_2
on-arrival: spd_support_thalmann = 1; reformist_dissent += 15; center_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 5; neorevisionist_dissent += 10; catholics_spd -= 5; workers_spd -= 3; kpd_relation += 10; communist_coalition += 2; z_relation -= 15; dvp_relation -= 15; ddp_relation -= 10; weimar_dissent += 3; wirth_campaign = 0; motivate_adenauer = 1 if z_relation < 50 and president == "Wirth"; adenauer_campaign = 1 if z_relation < 50

好。我们把支持投给了共产党的主席台尔曼。

- @final_election: The final results...

@support_munzenberg
subtitle: Supporting Münzenberg is unpopular among the reformists, but less so than Thälmann would've been.
view-if: kpd_party_leader == "Conciliators"
choose-if: kpd_relation >= 40 and reformist_strength < left_strength
unavailable-subtitle: [? if kpd_relation < 40 : 我们与共产党的关系还不够好,他们甚至不愿接受我们的支持。 ?] [? if reformist_strength >= left_strength : 改良派能够劝住全党,不支持这一安排。 ?]
on-arrival: spd_support_munzenberg = 1; kpd_relation += 5; reformist_dissent += 5; ddp_relation -= 3; dvp_relation -= 5; z_relation -= 5; wirth_campaign = 0; motivate_adenauer = 1 if z_relation < 50 and president == "Wirth"; adenauer_campaign = 1 if z_relation < 50

我们表态支持共产党的维利·明岑贝格。

- @final_election: The final results...

@support_gessler
subtitle: Otto Gessler is running as the DVP's candidate.
view-if: not dvp_banned and gessler_campaign and not wirth_campaign
on-arrival: left_dissent += 5; spd_support_gessler = 1; z_support_gessler = 1 if z_relation >= 45; adenauer_campaign = 0 if z_relation >= 45

We have endorsed Otto Gessler of the Bürgerblock. [? if z_relation >= 45 : 中央党随即跟进。 ?]

- @final_election: The final results...

@support_adenauer
subtitle: Konrad Adenauer may run as the Center Party's candidate.
view-if: not wirth_campaign
on-arrival: spd_support_adenauer = 1; adenauer_campaign = 1

我们表态支持中央党的康拉德·阿登纳。

- @final_election: The final results...

## todo: center support should be based on risks, so Z backs gessler alongside SPD if KPD strong, runs with SPD if DNVP/DVP strong, otherwise runs alone even if good relations

@spd_presidential

- @convince_z: Can we sway the Center Party?
- @convince_kpd: Can we convince the KPD?
- @final_election: The final results...

@convince_z
view-if: ((not z_support_braun and braun_campaign) or (not z_support_schumacher and schumacher_campaign)) and not zca_formed
choose-if: (z_relation >= 40 or (z_relation >= 35 and hergt_plurality)) and (z_votes < spd_votes + ddp_votes or (z_votes < spd_votes + ddp_votes + kpd_votes and (kpd_support_braun or kpd_support_schumacher)))
unavailable-subtitle: 中央党不愿被说服。

中央党目前并不支持我们的候选人,但愿意被说服。

- @pay_z: Promise to front the resources needed for a joint campaign.
- @appeal_hergt: Appeal to the threat of Oskar Hegt's election.
- @spd_presidential: Find another party to support us.

@pay_z
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: 我们没有这份资源。
on-arrival: resources -= 2; adenauer_campaign = 0; z_support_braun = 1 if braun_campaign; z_support_schumacher = 1 if schumacher_campaign
go-to: spd_presidential

中央党已表态支持我们的候选人,并退出了竞选。

@appeal_hergt
choose-if: z_relation >= 40
view-if: hergt_plurality
